A new device allows owners of a single-family home to equip themselves with a heat pump, without the cost of this installation representing an increase in their monthly expenses. To benefit from this mechanism, your resources must not exceed a certain ceiling.

The integrated offer for heat pumps was implemented on 1er October 2026. The aim is to simplify the replacement of fossil fuel (gas or oil) heating in a home with a heat pump, thanks to a « turnkey solution ». This device thus comprises:
- the installation of an air/water heat pump, manufactured in France or Europe and sized according to the needs of your home;
- an offer to supply electricity at a fixed price for 3 years;
- a maintenance contract of at least 3 years, covering regular maintenance and intervention in the event of a breakdown;
- a control solution to operate the heat pump at times when electricity is most available and cheapest;
